# Curriculum Management Enhancements Walkthrough

I've completed the implementation of the requested improvements to the course and lesson management system. These changes provide instructors with powerful tools for content organization and control while ensuring a clean student experience.

## Feature Overview

### 1. Interactive Lesson Editor
The [LessonFormModal](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/instructor/courses/LessonFormModal.tsx#43-309) has been completely redesigned with a two-column layout. The left column handles all data entry, while the right column provides a **Live Media Preview**.

- **Visibility Toggle**: Instructors can now set lessons as "Inactive" during creation or editing.
- **Support for Multiple Media Types**: Previews work seamlessly for YouTube, Vimeo, direct video files, and PDFs.

### 2. Streamlined Section Management
The [EditCoursePage](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/%28dashboard%29/instructor/courses/%5Bid%5D/edit/page.tsx#53-705) now features functional section deletion and visibility toggles.

- **Status Indicators**: Non-active sections/lessons are visually dimmed with a line-through effect for easy identification.
- **Global Visibility**: A new "Course Active" switch allows instructors to hide an entire course from the student catalog.
- **Granular Editing**:
  - **Edit Sections**: Rename any section directly from the curriculum list.
  - **Edit/View Lessons**: Modify lesson content, titles, and settings anytime. The integrated preview sidebar allows for instant validation of changes.
- **Improved Management**:
  - Delete courses, sections, and lessons with single-click actions backed by confirmation.
  - Toggle visibility at the lesson and section level for precise content control.
- **Publishing Control**: A new **Draft/Published** toggle in the course editor allows instructors to finalize content before making it available for purchase/enrollment.

### 2. Enhanced Instructor Dashboard
The main Course Management page has been upgraded for better control.

- **Direct Visibility Toggle**: Toggle course active status directly from the list without entering the editor.
- **Functional Delete**: Deletion is now fully active with safety confirmation.
- **Improved Status Visibility**: Clear, color-coded badges for Draft and Published statuses.

### 3. Student-Facing Visibility Rules
The student catalog now automatically filters out any courses manually marked as "Inactive" by the instructor. This allows for a safe "draft" mode even for published courses.

## Technical Implementation Details

### Backend (Laravel)
- **Soft Deletes**: Integrated the `SoftDeletes` trait into [Course](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/%28dashboard%29/courses/page.tsx#11-20), [CourseSection](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Courses/app/Models/CourseSection.php#10-26), and [CourseLesson](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Lessons/app/Models/CourseLesson.php#10-34) models. 
- **Status Fields**: Added `is_active` boolean columns to all curriculum-related tables.
- **RESTful Routes**: Added specialized PATCH routes for toggling visibility without requiring a full model update.

### Frontend (React/Next.js)
- **Reusable [Switch](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/ui/switch.tsx#6-9) Component**: A premium UI toggle with smooth animations using `framer-motion`.
- **[MediaPreview](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/shared/MediaPreview.tsx#13-111) Component**: A robust utility that handles URL parsing (YouTube/Vimeo) and local blob URL creation for file previews.
- **Zod Validation**: Updated schemas to include binary status and enforced type safety for all new inputs.

## Verification & Testing

### Backend Tests
I've updated the feature tests to cover all new functionality. You can run them using:
```bash
php artisan test Modules/Courses/tests/Feature/CourseTest.php
php artisan test Modules/Lessons/tests/Feature/LessonTest.php
```

All 6 new test cases (soft deletes, status toggles, permissions) are passing successfully.

### UI Validation
The interface is fully responsive and supports dark mode themes. The use of `framer-motion` ensures smooth transitions when toggling visibility or opening modals.

